out dec "\n\rRambler's slash DISEMBOWELS the duck!\n\rThe duck is DEAD!!\n\rThe duck spills his guts all over the floor.\n\rThe drunk has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
